## Common Parameters

1. Max Tokens - Controls length of Output (1 Token = 1 piece word)
2. Temperature - Controls how Creative or Predictable the AI is
3. Top P (Nucleus Sampling) - Controls Randomness by narrowing choices to top X% of motly likely options
4. Stop Sequence - Tell the model where to stop generating text


